l,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2013-09-16T00:33:05Z","updated_at":"2015-12-09T10:08:07Z","closed_at":"2015-12-09T10:08:07Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Originally reported by: **Mike Müller (BitBucket: [mmueller](http://bitbucket.org/mmueller), GitHub: @mmueller?)**\n\n---\n\nThe default for dummy variable produced with _--generate-rcfile_ has a regex that matches to the end of variable name but it should be just the beginning of name, as the help text suggests:\n\nThis\n\n```\n#!ini\n\n[VARIABLES]\n\n...\n\n# A regular expression matching the beginning of the name of dummy variables\n# (i.e. not used).\ndummy-variables-rgx=_$|dummy\n```\n\nshould become this:\n\n```\n#!ini\n\ndummy-variables-rgx=_|dummy\n```\n\nOtherwise the help text needs to be corrected to match the default values and both __|dummy_ would need to become __$|dummy$_ to be consistent. \n\n---\n- Bitbucket: https://bitbucket.org/logilab/pylint/issue/75\n","closed_by":{"login":"pylint-bot","id":16198247,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTk4MjQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16198247?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot","html_url":"https://github.com/pylint-bot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pylint-bot/events{